# Sway configuration for the headless test session. Everything the packaged
# default configuration does — a status bar, a terminal on a key binding, a
# menu — needs programs this image has not got, and a session that fails to
# start is not a session a test can observe anything in.
#
# Windows are given no decorations and the whole output, so what a test reads
# back from swaymsg is the dialog itself rather than a frame around it.
default_border none
default_floating_border none
focus_follows_mouse no
